From 4df4fc9f79812cded0be54224baccf0a7d1f2e3d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:33:07 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(project): step the project version to 77 for setup
 order

The saved setup `order` changes the posted program order. An older
reader that ignores the key posts a setup before its datum source with
no message. Step PROJECT_VERSION to 77, as the v50 rule asks: a v76
file has no `order`, opens unchanged and keeps name order; a reader of
an older version refuses a v77 file.

Pin: a_v76_file_keeps_name_order_and_a_newer_file_is_refused. Update
the deburr version pin and the continuous 4-axis example to the current
version. Correct the decision file and the setup.rs order comment.

Refs #3447

